passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $1,115M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 20.7%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 2.04"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":79.68,"default_fair_val":79.68,"premium_pct":112.6,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":32.3,"pe_forward":28.4,"pb_trailing":7.5,"pb_forward":6.8,"div_yield":0.68,"ps_ratio":7.9,"fcf_to_ev":3.21,"fcf_to_mcap":3.17,"liab_to_assets":20.7,"cash_to_assets":7.9,"current_ratio":2.04,"roe":23.3,"roa":18.5,"moat":{"ticker":"ODFL","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"ODFL 在北美零擔貨運市場建立了強大的品牌聲譽，以其可靠性、準時性和卓越的客戶服務而聞名。這種聲譽轉化為定價能力，使其能夠在市場上收取溢價，尤其是在對服務質量要求較高的客戶群體中。相較於一些價格導向的競爭對手，ODFL 的品牌忠誠度較高，這構成了一定的進入壁壘。然而，貨運行業本質上仍具有一定的商品屬性，極端的定價權難以實現，因此評分為 7。","comment_en":"ODFL has established a strong brand reputation in the North American less-than-truckload (LTL) freight market, known for its reliability, on-time performance, and superior customer service. This reputation translates into pricing power, allowing it to command a premium in the market, especially among customer segments that prioritize service quality. Compared to some price-driven competitors, ODFL enjoys higher brand loyalty, which forms a certain barrier to entry. However, the freight industry inherently retains some commodity characteristics, making extreme pricing power difficult to achieve, hence the score of 7."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"貨運行業，特別是零擔貨運，主要依賴於營運效率、網絡佈局和客戶服務，而非專利或獨特的技術壁壘。監管環境對所有參與者都是相似的，並未為 ODFL 提供顯著的專利或特許經營優勢。因此，在這個維度上，ODFL 的護城河非常薄弱，幾乎不存在基於專利或監管的獨特優勢。","comment_en":"The freight industry, particularly LTL, relies heavily on operational efficiency, network coverage, and customer service, rather than patents or unique technological barriers. The regulatory environment is similar for all participants and does not provide ODFL with significant patent or proprietary regulatory advantages. Therefore, ODFL's moat in this dimension is very weak, with virtually no unique advantages based on patents or regulations."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"對於依賴 ODFL 提供準時、可靠運輸服務的客戶而言，更換供應商的成本相當高。這不僅包括尋找新供應商、重新談判合同的直接成本，更重要的是潛在的營運中斷風險、服務質量下降以及與新供應商磨合的隱性成本。ODFL 的高服務標準和可靠性，使得客戶一旦習慣其服務，便難以輕易轉移，這構成了堅實的轉換成本壁壘。","comment_en":"For customers who rely on ODFL for timely and reliable transportation services, the cost of switching suppliers is considerable. This includes not only the direct costs of finding a new provider and renegotiating contracts but, more importantly, the potential risks of operational disruption, decline in service quality, and the hidden costs of integrating with a new supplier. ODFL's high service standards and reliability make it difficult for customers to switch easily once accustomed to its service, forming a solid switching cost barrier."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"ODFL 的網絡效應體現在其廣泛的地理覆蓋範圍和密集的貨運站點網絡。隨著 ODFL 網絡的擴大和效率的提升，它能為更多客戶提供更優質的服務，吸引更多貨運量，進一步增強其網絡的價值。這種正向循環使得競爭對手難以複製其規模和效率，尤其是在跨區域運輸方面。雖然不是典型的社交網絡效應，但其網絡的規模和效率確實帶來了競爭優勢。","comment_en":"ODFL's network effects are reflected in its extensive geographic coverage and dense network of freight terminals. As ODFL expands its network and improves its efficiency, it can offer better services to more customers, attracting greater freight volumes, which further enhances the value of its network. This virtuous cycle makes it difficult for competitors to replicate its scale and efficiency, especially in cross-regional transportation. While not a typical social network effect, the scale and efficiency of its network do provide a competitive advantage."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"ODFL 作為北美最大的零擔貨運公司之一，其規模帶來了顯著的成本優勢。規模經濟體現在採購方面的議價能力（如燃油、車輛）、更高的運載率、更優化的路線規劃以及更低的單位固定成本攤銷。這種成本結構使其能夠在價格上與競爭對手抗衡，同時保持健康的利潤率，這是一個強大的競爭壁壘。","comment_en":"As one of the largest LTL carriers in North America, ODFL's scale provides significant cost advantages. Economies of scale are evident in its bargaining power for procurement (e.g., fuel, vehicles), higher load factors, optimized route planning, and lower amortization of fixed costs per unit. This cost structure allows it to compete on price with rivals while maintaining healthy profit margins, representing a formidable competitive barrier."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"ODFL 擁有廣泛的貨運站點網絡，遍佈美國主要經濟區域，這構成了一種地理上的優勢。其密集的網絡使其能夠提供高效的門到門服務，並在特定區域內形成區域性的網絡優勢。然而，貨運行業的資產（如貨運站點、卡車）相對標準化，雖然網絡的密度和效率是優勢，但並非絕對不可複製的資產，因此評分為 6。","comment_en":"ODFL possesses an extensive network of freight terminals across major economic regions in the United States, which constitutes a geographical advantage. Its dense network enables it to provide efficient door-to-door service and establish regional network strengths within specific areas. However, assets in the freight industry (like terminals and trucks) are relatively standardized. While network density and efficiency are advantages, they are not absolutely unique or irreplicable assets, hence the score of 6."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"ODFL 在營運效率方面表現卓越，這在其持續領先的準時率和低損壞率數據中得到體現。公司不斷投資於技術和流程優化，以提高貨物處理速度、路線規劃效率和車輛利用率。這種卓越的營運能力不僅降低了成本，也直接提升了客戶滿意度和忠誠度，是其核心競爭力之一，構成了難以被追趕的壁壘。","comment_en":"ODFL demonstrates exceptional operational efficiency, evident in its consistently leading on-time performance and low damage rates. The company continuously invests in technology and process optimization to enhance freight handling speed, route planning efficiency, and vehicle utilization. This superior operational capability not only reduces costs but also directly improves customer satisfaction and loyalty, making it one of its core competitive strengths and forming a difficult-to-replicate barrier."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"ODFL 在資本配置方面展現了長期以來的審慎和有效性。公司歷史上持續將自由現金流再投資於擴張網絡、升級設備和技術，同時也通過股票回購和股息向股東返還價值。其穩健的資產負債表（低負債）和持續的盈利能力證明了管理層在資本配置上的智慧。這種穩健的資本配置策略有助於公司長期可持續的增長和價值創造。","comment_en":"ODFL has demonstrated prudence and effectiveness in capital allocation over the long term. Historically, the company has consistently reinvested free cash flow into expanding its network, upgrading equipment and technology, while also returning value to shareholders through share buybacks and dividends. Its strong balance sheet (low debt) and consistent profitability attest to management's wisdom in capital allocation. This sound capital allocation strategy contributes to the company's long-term sustainable growth and value creation."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"如 M3 所述，ODFL 的高服務質量和可靠性極大地提高了客戶黏性。一旦客戶體驗到 ODFL 的優勢，轉換到其他供應商的意願就會降低。公司通過持續的服務改進和客戶關係管理，進一步鞏固了客戶基礎。這種高客戶保留率是其穩定營收和利潤的關鍵，構成了顯著的護城河。","comment_en":"As mentioned in M3, ODFL's high service quality and reliability significantly enhance customer stickiness. Once customers experience ODFL's advantages, their willingness to switch to other providers decreases. The company further solidifies its customer base through continuous service improvements and customer relationship management. This high customer retention rate is key to its stable revenue and profits, forming a significant moat."},"m10_durability":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"零擔貨運行業具有一定的週期性，但 ODFL 作為行業領導者，憑藉其規模、效率和客戶忠誠度，展現了較強的抗週期能力和業務的持久性。其核心業務不易受到短期市場波動的劇烈影響，且不易被新興技術顛覆（相較於某些其他行業）。只要經濟活動持續，對可靠運輸的需求就將長期存在，ODFL 的商業模式具有良好的持久性。","comment_en":"The LTL freight industry is somewhat cyclical, but ODFL, as an industry leader, demonstrates strong resilience to cycles and durability in its business due to its scale, efficiency, and customer loyalty. Its core business is not severely impacted by short-term market fluctuations and is not easily disrupted by emerging technologies (compared to some other industries). As long as economic activity continues, the demand for reliable transportation will persist long-term, giving ODFL's business model good durability."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"ODFL 憑藉其在北美零擔貨運市場的領導地位，建立了堅實的經濟護城河。其核心優勢體現在卓越的營運效率（M7）、規模帶來的成本優勢（M5）以及由此產生的客戶轉換成本（M3）和網絡效應（M4）。這些因素共同作用，使得 ODFL 能夠提供高於行業平均水平的服務質量和可靠性，從而獲得客戶的深度忠誠（M9）。儘管行業存在一定的商品屬性（M1），但 ODFL 的品牌和服務質量使其具備一定的定價能力。其資本配置策略（M8）和業務的持久性（M10）也為其長期價值奠定了基礎。專利或監管壁壘（M2）幾乎不存在，地理資產（M6）雖有優勢但非絕對獨佔。總體而言，ODFL 是一家具有強大收費橋模式特徵的公司，其護城河堅固且具備持續擴張的潛力。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"ODFL has built a solid economic moat through its leadership position in the North American less-than-truckload (LTL) freight market. Its core strengths lie in exceptional operational efficiency (M7), cost advantages derived from scale (M5), and the resulting customer switching costs (M3) and network effects (M4). These factors collectively enable ODFL to deliver service quality and reliability above the industry average, fostering deep customer loyalty (M9). Despite some commodity characteristics in the industry (M1), ODFL's brand and service quality provide it with a degree of pricing power. Its capital allocation strategy (M8) and business durability (M10) also underpin its long-term value. While patent or regulatory barriers (M2) are virtually non-existent, and geographical assets (M6) offer advantages, they are not absolutely exclusive. Overall, ODFL exhibits strong characteristics of a 'toll bridge' business model, with a robust moat and potential for continued expansion.","evidenceHash":"7cb0ce7bea277e4c5883d937cd0a2c5ccb571917fd247cf4e9be053ebd253af0","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":9,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-29T14:27:37.063Z","evidenceHash":"1034ab857ae83fc1c0552b568d734428700e6c25836f33fbaad33e77670b42d8"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-29T14:27:37.063Z","evidenceHash":"1034ab857ae83fc1c0552b568d734428700e6c25836f33fbaad33e77670b42d8"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/ODFL.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/ODFL.png","website":"https://www.odfl.com","ceo":"Kevin Freeman","full_time_employees":"20591","description":"Old Dominion Freight Line, Inc. (ODFL) serves as a prominent less-than-truckload (LTL) freight carrier operating across the United States and North America. The company's offerings include LTL shipping solutions at regional, inter-regional, and national levels, often featuring expedited delivery options. Furthermore, ODFL provides a variety of supplementary services, such as container drayage, truckload brokerage, and supply chain consultancy. Founded in 1934, Old Dominion Freight Line, Inc. has its corporate headquarters situated in Thomasville, North Carolina.","description_en":"Old Dominion Freight Line, Inc. (ODFL) serves as a prominent less-than-truckload (LTL) freight carrier operating across the United States and North America. The company's offerings include LTL shipping solutions at regional, inter-regional, and national levels, often featuring expedited delivery options. Furthermore, ODFL provides a variety of supplementary services, such as container drayage, truckload brokerage, and supply chain consultancy. Founded in 1934, Old Dominion Freight Line, Inc. has its corporate headquarters situated in Thomasville, North Carolina.","description_zh":"Old Dominion Freight Line, Inc.（美股代碼：ODFL）為 Industrials 領域之重要企業，專注於 Trucking 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"500 Old Dominion Way","city":"Thomasville","state":"NC","zip":"27360","country":"US","phone":"336 889 5000","full_address":"500 Old Dominion Way, Thomasville, NC 27360, US","range_52w":"126.01-252.03","year_high":252.03,"year_low":126.01,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":126.01,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-09-24","name":"JACKMAN WORTHING","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":545,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-24","name":"JACKMAN WORTHING","title":"Officer / Director","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-26","name":"Overbey Cecil E. Jr.","title":"officer: SVP - Strategic Development","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":19952,"price":198.39,"total_val":3.96},{"date":"2026-05-28","name":"CONGDON DAVID S","title":"director, officer: Executive Chairman","is_buy":null,"action":"G-Gift","shares":295670,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-05-21","name":"Davis Andrew Stephen","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":859,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-05-20","name":"Stith Thomas A. III","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":859,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-05-20","name":"Stallings Wendy T.","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":859,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-05-20","name":"Smith Albert Randolph II","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":859,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-05-20","name":"Gantt Greg C","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":859,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-05-20","name":"Gabosch Bradley R","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":859,"price":0,"total_val":0}],"stock_splits":[{"date":"2024-03-28","ratio":"2 : 1","desc":"供應商報告的股數調整比例；未獨立核實事件類型。","type":"FMP 股數調整"},{"date":